# Root build context is only used by llama-server/Dockerfile (CPU) and
# llama-server/Dockerfile.gpu (GPU), which need llama/ or llama-gpu/,
# model-qwen3.5/, and start-llama-server.sh or start-llama-server-gpu.sh.
# Everything else here would otherwise be sent to the Docker daemon as build
# context for no reason.
*
!llama/
!llama/**
!llama-gpu/
!llama-gpu/**
!model-qwen3.5/
!model-qwen3.5/**
!start-llama-server.sh
!start-llama-server-gpu.sh
